x402-rs is a port to Rust of the PHP library quebracho/x402
(https://github.com/quebracho-digital/x402, MIT), by the same author, Leo Fishman,
released here under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

crates/quebracho-x402-screening/ofac-sdn.json holds the digital currency addresses of the
U.S. Treasury's OFAC SDN list (https://ofac.treasury.gov/sanctions-list-service), a public
U.S. government work, as shipped by quebracho/x402.

conformance/vectors/ are generated by running quebracho/x402 (see conformance/README.md).
